# ApkaLawyer Frontend Environment Configuration (Placeholders only)
# IMPORTANT: NEVER place real secrets, private tokens, database keys, or payment secrets here.
# Any variable exposed to the frontend MUST start with VITE_.
# Server-side secrets must NEVER use VITE_ and must only exist on a secure server/edge runtime.

